type: software
title: "Avibacterium paragallinarum cgMLST analysis scripts"
abstract: "Scripts for core-genome MLST (cgMLST), cgSNP and HMTp210 serotype analysis of Avibacterium paragallinarum genomes, used in: 'A standardized core genome MLST scheme for Avibacterium paragallinarum traces outbreaks and reveals region-specific lineages'."
